# fm (2026-11-24): minimal flat recipe, legged_gym style. fx/fy (o50 guard set, full from it 0) stood still on every
# axis. Stage 1 = command sequences on every tile, velocity tracking (OTRACK 24) + stall, feet air time (W_AIR 8,
# swing 0.3-1.2 s), stop terms for zero segments, safety (fall, torque, limits, collisions, slip, stance, trunk, knee);
# landing costs, roll/hike, BWC envelopes off; regularisation ramped over 3000 its. Guards return one at a time.
